{"name": "Holomancer", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The World Was Born</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Holomancer</strong>, magic flows through circuits and will alike. You are a wielder of forgotten forces, learning to harvest the living world and transmute raw mana into form, function, and meaning. Creation is an act of intention here, and every choice leaves an imprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The corruption stirs beneath the surface. Stand against it, or simply endure it, guided by the Goddess, who watches, aids, and listens as you grow. Between conflict, there is stillness, drifting light, quiet landscapes, and music that breathes with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a world in formation. Join us in Early Access as <strong>Holomancer</strong>unfolds, evolves, and slowly reveals what it is meant to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Weapons\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield a an array of Weapons in high-octane combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/bd7b780da4e2905a7d3d3a19d4a0fc10.poster.avif?t=1782524645\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/bd7b780da4e2905a7d3d3a19d4a0fc10.webm?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/bd7b780da4e2905a7d3d3a19d4a0fc10.mp4?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Creativity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your survival depends on your creative ability to create effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/15003dd4b015b60b2e9b10e7d916caa7.poster.avif?t=1782524645\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/15003dd4b015b60b2e9b10e7d916caa7.webm?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/15003dd4b015b60b2e9b10e7d916caa7.mp4?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse an endless, procedurally generated overworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/4320ef623c12bed0a2de2b305df3ecdc.poster.avif?t=1782524645\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/4320ef623c12bed0a2de2b305df3ecdc.webm?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/extras/4320ef623c12bed0a2de2b305df3ecdc.mp4?t=1782524645\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Holomancer is a sandbox shooter set on a living, procedurally generated world. Harvest mana, materialize tools, and face off against the corrupted as you explore and grow in a world still taking shape.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706440/4aee7091db127dab51335782261a2dfa891a2ec9/header.jpg?t=1782524645", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Exploratio